Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Alex", "email": "alex@jedi.com" }

### 2. Cream User 2 (Mihnea)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mihnea", "email": "mihnea@jedi.com" }

### 3. Adaugam o carte in catalog (cu 1 singur exemplar fizic)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Spring Boot Mastery", "copies": 1 }

