### 4. Alex IMPRUMUTA cartea (Stocul devine 0)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/69c3123637e67e7f63f00416/borrow
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userEmail": "alex@jedi.com" }

### 5. Mihnea incearca si el (Va primi EROARE 409 controlata)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/69c3123637e67e7f63f00416/borrow
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userEmail": "mihnea@jedi.com" }

### 6. Mihnea da RESERVE (Intra in coada de asteptare)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/69c3123637e67e7f63f00416/reserve
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userEmail": "mihnea@jedi.com" }

### 7. Alex RETURNEAZA cartea (Primeste XP, iar cartea se duce la Mihnea)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books/69c3123637e67e7f63f00416/return
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userEmail": "alex@jedi.com" }